00:02:07.224 --> 00:02:08.791
Ha! Ha! Yeah!

00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:10.183
[crowd cheering]

00:02:10.227 --> 00:02:12.229
[grunting]

00:02:12.272 --> 00:02:14.013
