00:02:15.537 --> 00:02:16.363
Yes!

00:02:16.407 --> 00:02:17.800
Did you hear that, Carol?

00:02:17.843 --> 00:02:20.019
We have a girl group now!

00:02:20.063 --> 00:02:22.413
